ar Parking Driving Simulator VR", "keywords": ["RealCarParking", "DrivingSimulatorVR", "CarParkingVR", "CarParkingDriving", "ParkingDrivingSimulator"], "long_description": "Real Car Parking Driving Simulator VR is a simple and fun VR car parking game where you can practice parking driving in a realistic environment. Drive your car, follow the parking area, and carefully park your vehicle in the correct place.\n\nEnjoy Real Car Parking Driving Simulator VR with easy controls and smooth driving gameplay. The car parking challenges are designed to test your driving and parking skills. Practice parking driving, control your car, and complete each parking challenge.\n\nReal Car Parking Driving Simulator VR gives you an enjoyable car parking experience in VR. Improve your parking skills, drive carefully, and complete every level. Start your parking driving challenge and enjoy realistic VR car driving.\n", "short_description": "Real Car Parking Driving Simulator VR is a fun VR car parking game. Practice parking driving, control your car, complete parking challenges, and improve your driving skills in an enjoyable VR experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/top-art-games/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Top Art Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/top-art-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SI